  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Business Overview:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://soykitty.com/products/ecofriendly-soybean-cat-litter\" title=\"SoyKitty eco-friendly, plant-based cat litter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SoyKitty</a> is a DTC cat startup that sells eco-friendly, all-natural, plant-based cat litter in the U.S. market.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The litter is free of toxins, chemicals, and artificial additives, appealing to pet owners who prioritize natural and holistic pet care.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Target Audience:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Affluent cat owners (typically women) who have one or more cats.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Hyper-focused on apartment/condo owning pet parents in urban populations, (Los Angeles, New York City, San Francisco, San Diego, Seattle, Portland, Chicago, Dallas, D.C, Baltimore, Philadelphia, Boston, Miami).</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">People who already live (or are starting to live) a holistic, all-natural lifestyle.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">These customers are actively removing toxins, chemicals, and artificial products from their home and their cat&rsquo;s environment.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">They are already researching and prioritizing health, well-being, and safe ingredients.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Who we are NOT targeting:</span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Cat owners who don&rsquo;t care about holistic living or aren&rsquo;t questioning toxins in their home.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">People looking for the cheapest litter option.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Those who need to be convinced about the benefits of natural products.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><!-- notionvc: 6fb8896c-50a6-4800-ae60-9ce1c91b7d98 --></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Product description:&nbsp;</strong>SoyKity cat litter is a premium, eco-friendly cat litter made from plant byproducts. It's completely dust-free, clumps in seconds, absorbs moisture 3x better than clay and 2x better than crystal litter, and is 100% flushable.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>We create superior-performing, eco-friendly cat litter that is sustainably sourced, nontoxic, and made with biodegradable materials. It&rsquo;s better for you, your cats, and the planet.</span></p>",
